/** @mainpage simulation

GazeboでロボットとLiDARを再現し、2D・3Dの地図作成、走行、清掃経路と帰還を試す。点群の選別、センサ値の調整、帰還位置の保存も含む。

各ファイルの説明からソースと宣言を参照できる。C/C++・Arduino・Python・JavaはDoxygenで解析する。Dart・Kotlin・ROS型定義・シェルはソース掲載ページを使う。コメントのない関数も一覧に含むが、その動作が説明済みという意味ではない。

@section source_list ファイル一覧

- @ref launch/slam_3d_glim.launch.py "launch/slam_3d_glim.launch.py"
- config/glim/: GLIMのCPUモジュール、仮想座標系、センサ時刻・前処理の設定。

- @ref launch/slam_3d_linefit.launch.py "launch/slam_3d_linefit.launch.py"

- @ref src/linefit_ground_filter.cpp "src/linefit_ground_filter.cpp"
- @ref launch/coverage_3d_linefit.launch.py "launch/coverage_3d_linefit.launch.py"
- config/linefit_ground.yaml: Linefitの距離・線当てはめ・地面判定閾値。


- @ref launch/coverage_2d.launch.py "launch/coverage_2d.launch.py"

- @ref launch/coverage_3d.launch.py "launch/coverage_3d.launch.py"

- @ref launch/diagnose_3d.launch.py "launch/diagnose_3d.launch.py"

- @ref launch/nav_2d.launch.py "launch/nav_2d.launch.py"

- @ref launch/nav_3d.launch.py "launch/nav_3d.launch.py"

- @ref launch/simulation_launch.py "launch/simulation_launch.py"

- @ref launch/slam_2d.launch.py "launch/slam_2d.launch.py"

- @ref launch/slam_3d.launch.py "launch/slam_3d.launch.py"

- @ref scripts/home_pose_saver.py "scripts/home_pose_saver.py"

- @ref scripts/nodding_io.py "scripts/nodding_io.py"

- @ref scripts/pointcloud_height_filter.py "scripts/pointcloud_height_filter.py"

- @ref scripts/sensor_covariance_adapter.py "scripts/sensor_covariance_adapter.py"

- @ref src/get_home_pose.cpp "src/get_home_pose.cpp"

*/

/** @file launch/coverage_2d.launch.py
